sequenceDiagram
  participant Buyer as Procurement Manager
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant ORD as Order Service
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant INV as Inventory Service
  participant ANA as Analytics Service
  Buyer->>GW: POST /api/orders/{id}/complete
  GW->>ORD: Forward completion
  ORD->>ORD: Mark order COMPLETED
  ORD->>MQ: Publish procurement.completed
  MQ->>INV: Update stock by SKU
  MQ->>ANA: Store demand history

